SCOPE

This licence covers the code in this repository: the `brrag/` package, the
`tools/` scripts and the prose in `docs/` and `README.md`.

It does NOT cover the age-grading tables or the source artefacts. Those are the
work of others:

  * age-grade factors and age standards — compiled by Alan Jones with
    single-age bests by Tom Bernhard, approved by the Masters Long Distance
    Running Council of USA Track & Field.
    Upstream: https://github.com/AlanLyttonJones/Age-Grade-Tables
  * the calculator page (`page.html`) and the factors workbook
    (`MLDRRoadFactors2025.xlsm`) — Howard Grubb,
    https://www.howardgrubb.co.uk/athletics/

They are included here unmodified, for reference and reproducibility, with
SHA-256 hashes recorded in `data/source_sha256.txt`. Cite the upstream sources,
not this repository, when publishing graded results.
